Err.. OPTIONS=color in .nethackrc is all I've ever needed for it.
And the game has to be compiled with #define TEXTCOLOR in unixconf.h, but
that's defined by default.
And in src/Makefile, have WINTTYLIB = -lncurses uncommented and 
WINTTYLIB = -ltermlib commented out, that may have some effect.

